{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XrYZgrYGsvEzLqZTDNTeBy","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"83411b2f8a52325e867fccc223a54d6a6f701400","date":"2026-10-06T22:20:08+03:00","message":"TRUNK-6819: Start the JobRunr job server only once OpenMRS has started (#6654)","refs":"","body":"The background job server was started while its application context was\nstill being created, so jobs could run before the context was ready. On\njetty:run this logged \"EntityManagerFactory is closed\" for a job that ran\nduring the context refresh after modules start, against the closed session\nfactory of the context being replaced, and \"Task class ... not found\" for a\nmodule's job that ran after the first, core-only refresh, before modules\nwere loaded.\n\nThe server is now started by a SmartLifecycle once its context has finished\nrefreshing and stopped before the context closes. The webapp defers that\nstart until SchedulerService.onStartup(), which runs once modules have\nstarted; contexts refreshed after startup start their server right away.\n\nThe webapp never closes its application context, so Context.shutdown() now\ncalls SchedulerService.onShutdown() first, as it did before the move to\nJobRunr, and JobRunrSchedulerService stops the job server there, before the\nmodules and the session factory are shut down.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NK4kFG8qyevx9Bk9jWoEgS\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PdDdZrB8Q5eMgej5FmRx4R\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LZ92BDLHrn6xACczVMtSiR","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"c648b04913a53f80bf26449c3e5da985f84e76cb","date":"2026-03-18T12:58:32+01:00","message":"TRUNK-6558 Fixes after cherry-picking","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"rkorytkowski","authorEmail":"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"d2df9cd0356b6736482e9745e3811da6bd1580ff","date":"2026-03-17T12:46:51+01:00","message":"TRUNK-6558 Upgrade SchedulerService to use JobRunr (#5893)","refs":"","body":"(cherry picked from commit d74673b1ffe32af40917fcbcd55c0e6d64686db0)\n","authorName":"Rafal Korytkowski","authorEmail":"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"9292efb64f3e1f35c3ed02619694c3444b5f2323","date":"2026-03-12T13:05:09-04:00","message":"Migrate to using Spotless for formatting (#5911)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"b42378593a81b7178d884d8a4eca35eb221e703c","date":"2025-10-10T12:28:04-04:00","message":"TRUNK-6441: Configure DocBuilderFactory to disallow loading remote data (#5385)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"fb43aba1896457b82ebf133a5842dcbbae5ae8ea","date":"2025-10-02T11:07:37+02:00","message":"TRUNK-6436: Add logging to monitor startup performance","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"rkorytkowski","authorEmail":"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"6cc0634620e2ccc6518c7916ae7d7315621bc889","date":"2025-10-01T12:55:23+02:00","message":"Adding log messages for profiling","refs":"","body":"(cherry picked from commit 1a519bb17dd008a89ae4635eb3ab0286ed2c0e91)\n","authorName":"rkorytkowski","authorEmail":"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"d57ebefa27095e18e35649504385b1c0b06d4677","date":"2025-08-11T01:43:28+03:00","message":"Ignore shutdown errors","refs":"","body":"(cherry picked from commit b6f738df2652e708c7e14fcc52d63c988e9da80d)\n","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"63ce2b2a767f9436c3a15307a6a37be35c90b9f5","date":"2025-07-21T22:12:09+01:00","message":"TRUNK-6332: Hibernate 6.x and spring 6.x upgrade (#5062)","refs":"","body":"* TRUNK-6332: Hibernate 6.x and spring 6.x upgrade\n\n* TRUNK-6332: Upgrade h2 to 2.x\n\n* TRUNK-6332: Fix obs test\n\n* TRUNK-6332: Fix obs test\n\n* TRUNK-6332: Remove java 8 from pipelines\n\n* TRU